 "case:locations.analysis_room.description": "The analysis room smells of instant coffee, wool coats and dry-erase marker. Three demonstration boards are covered in half-finished variations. It opens directly onto the service corridor, though the public entrance is through the foyer.",
 "case:locations.analysis_room.hotspots.hs_analysis_board.label": "The demonstration board",
 "case:locations.analysis_room.hotspots.hs_analysis_board.text": "The main demonstration board shows the final position from Round Eight’s quickest draw. Two pieces are still in the wrong squares, and the black king has been placed on the side normally used for the arbiter’s initials.",
 "case:locations.analysis_room.hotspots.hs_analysis_coats.label": "The coat rack",
 "case:locations.analysis_room.hotspots.hs_analysis_coats.text": "The players’ coats hang from numbered hooks. Viktor’s dark jacket is missing, but his tournament badge is still clipped to the empty hook. A thread of black wool has caught on the corridor-side latch.",
 "case:locations.analysis_room.hotspots.hs_analysis_notebook.label": "Viktor’s analysis notebook",
 "case:locations.analysis_room.hotspots.hs_analysis_notebook.text": "A notebook left beside the main board contains a line of analysis in Viktor Markovski’s hand. He has written the position from Maja Velkova’s game, then added a time in the margin: 18:06.",
 "case:locations.analysis_room.hotspots.hs_analysis_table.label": "The coffee table",
 "case:locations.analysis_room.hotspots.hs_analysis_table.text": "Paper cups and score sheets cover the table. A café receipt has been folded into a square and tucked under a sugar packet. The time is during the official break.",
 "case:locations.analysis_room.name": "The analysis room",
