 "case:locations.arbiter_room.description": "The room is barely large enough for Boris’s desk, two filing cabinets and a folding chair. The public door opens onto the back of the stage. A second door, normally kept locked, leads into the service corridor. Boris’s green desk lamp is still on.",
 "case:locations.arbiter_room.hotspots.hs_room_desk.label": "The arbiter’s desk",
 "case:locations.arbiter_room.hotspots.hs_room_desk.text": "Boris’s desk has been photographed but not cleared. The telephone is off its cradle. A half-drunk coffee has gone cold beside an open results ledger, while the sealed envelope is missing.",
 "case:locations.arbiter_room.hotspots.hs_room_envelope.label": "The empty drawer",
 "case:locations.arbiter_room.hotspots.hs_room_envelope.text": "The shallow drawer where Boris kept appeals and disciplinary reports is open. Its paper dust is undisturbed except for a clean rectangle where a thick envelope was removed.",
 "case:locations.arbiter_room.hotspots.hs_room_files.label": "The filing cabinets",
 "case:locations.arbiter_room.hotspots.hs_room_files.text": "The cabinets hold old tournament reports and federation correspondence. One folder from a 2018 event has been pulled forward, although nothing else in the row has moved.",
 "case:locations.arbiter_room.hotspots.hs_room_service.label": "The service door",
 "case:locations.arbiter_room.hotspots.hs_room_service.text": "The service door has a spring hinge and a small brass number: SERVICE 2. There is fresh black grease on the latch and a faint scrape in the paint at shoulder height. The corridor beyond is too narrow for the door to stand open.",
 "case:locations.arbiter_room.name": "The arbiter’s room",
 "case:locations.arbiter_room.summary": "A cramped office behind the stage, with the victim’s desk, tournament files and a service door.",
