 "case:locations.foyer.art.props.4.label": "Poster wall",
 "case:locations.foyer.description": "The foyer is brighter and louder than the hall. A café counter runs along one wall, while the Bitola Chess Club has placed its registration books and sponsor folders on folding tables. The street door opens onto the lamps and evening traffic of Širok Sokak.",
 "case:locations.foyer.hotspots.hs_foyer_cafe.label": "The café till",
 "case:locations.foyer.hotspots.hs_foyer_cafe.text": "The café server remembers a double espresso ordered during the break. The receipt was paid by card, but the customer asked for it folded before leaving.",
 "case:locations.foyer.hotspots.hs_foyer_key.label": "The service-key log",
 "case:locations.foyer.hotspots.hs_foyer_key.text": "The club’s key log is clipped beneath the registration desk. SERVICE 2 was signed out at 17:52 for ‘courtyard access’ and returned at 18:18. The return line has no name.",
 "case:locations.foyer.hotspots.hs_foyer_press.label": "The press table",
 "case:locations.foyer.hotspots.hs_foyer_press.text": "The local paper has left a camera bag and a notebook beside the registration books. A page is headed ‘Boris Vasilev and the 2018 appeal’, but the next page has been torn out.",
 "case:locations.foyer.hotspots.hs_foyer_register.label": "The registration books",
 "case:locations.foyer.hotspots.hs_foyer_register.text": "The attendance book lists every player, coach and official who entered the building. Viktor Markovski signed out a staff key during the break; the line beside it is the only one without a return signature.",
 "case:locations.foyer.hotspots.hs_foyer_sponsor.label": "The sponsor folder",
 "case:locations.foyer.hotspots.hs_foyer_sponsor.text": "The sponsor’s folder contains the city grant application, the prize budget and a letter promising a record final-round audience. The numbers have been revised in pencil.",
 "case:locations.foyer.name": "The foyer and club office",
 "case:locations.foyer.summary": "The café counter, registration desk, sponsor table and the door onto Širok Sokak.",
