 "case:locations.hall.description": "The main hall is a long municipal room with tall windows facing Širok Sokak. Boards fill the floor in numbered rows. At the far end, a raised stage holds the demonstration board, the covered trophy and a brass bell on a small table. The arbiter’s room is behind the stage, reached from the public hall or a staff corridor.",
 "case:locations.hall.hotspots.hs_hall_bell.label": "The round bell",
 "case:locations.hall.hotspots.hs_hall_bell.text": "The brass bell is missing from the stage table. Its square wooden base is still there, with a clean pale outline where the bell stood. A single dark fibre clings to one corner.",
 "case:locations.hall.hotspots.hs_hall_clocks.label": "The clock-control sheet",
 "case:locations.hall.hotspots.hs_hall_clocks.text": "An official control sheet lies under the results board. It records the final clock checks and every manual adjustment made during the round. One entry in the break is initialled with a player’s handwriting rather than an arbiter’s.",
 "case:locations.hall.hotspots.hs_hall_plan.label": "The hall plan",
 "case:locations.hall.hotspots.hs_hall_plan.text": "A faded fire-escape plan beside the stage shows the public hall, the foyer café, the analysis room and the arbiter’s room. A narrow service corridor runs behind the stage and has a door at each end. It is marked for staff use only.",
 "case:locations.hall.hotspots.hs_hall_results.label": "The results board",
 "case:locations.hall.hotspots.hs_hall_results.text": "The standings have been erased from the bottom row but not rewritten. Maja Velkova is still listed half a point ahead of the field. Beneath the board, a blank result slip is pinned to the wall with a red-headed drawing pin.",
 "case:locations.hall.hotspots.hs_hall_scores.label": "The score-sheet tray",
 "case:locations.hall.hotspots.hs_hall_scores.text": "The completed score sheets from Round Eight have been gathered in a plastic tray. Most are clipped in pairs. One board number has been written twice, then crossed out in blue ink.",
 "case:locations.hall.name": "The tournament hall",
